<title>PHILIPPINES: San Miguel gets Miller licence.</title>
<headline>San Miguel gets Miller licence.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Beer and food conglomerate San Miguel Corp said on Thursday it forged a licencing accord with the U.S.-based Miller Brewing Co to produce and distribute Miller Genuine Draft in the Philippine market.</p>
</text>
